description	"The Heavy Supression Trooper

The Heavy Supression Trooper is equipped with a repeating blaster which has double the rate of fire of a normal clone trooper repeating blaster rifle (at level 3), but for reduced damage per shot. It is an effective supression class. It is very slow moving but can sprint in short bursts.

^2Weaponry:
- Z6 Rotary Blaster Cannon (3)
-- 30% Less DMG
-- 50% Higher RoF
-- 400% more Velocity

^8Attributes:
- Magnetic Plated Armor
- Stamina (40% Cap) (2)
- CTF: 35s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]

^2Strengths^7: Devestating Against Gunners, and particularly effective at long range against jetpack classes.
^1Weaknesses^7: Sluggish and very vulnerable to grenades and other explosives."